2. Game design and content — not covered by the MIT grant
=========================================================

Supe Pines adapts the tabletop story game *Tall Pines*, designed by Miles
Gaborit, by way of the sibling project Bleakwood Vale. The game's rules,
structure, and card concepts derive from that design.

The MIT grant above does NOT cover:

- the game rules and structure derived from *Tall Pines*;
- the game text in js/data/ (Cases, Heroes, Threats, Signals, Scenes,
  Secrets, and other card and story copy);
- the artwork in art/.

All rights in the original *Tall Pines* design remain with its rights
holder. Supe Pines' own adaptation text and artwork are not licensed for
reuse. To reuse any of this material, ask the rights holder for permission
first.
